## Build → Install → Run workflow（示例）

这个文档示例用于“编译/安装完成后，在手机上跑一段 workflow 并落盘产物（截图/焦点/logcat/可选录屏）”。

说明：
- 编译/安装通常由你项目自己的脚本/CI 完成（Gradle/Xcode/Flutter/ReactNative 等），完成后只需要调用 `android_run_workflow_from_doc`。
- 如果你需要“安装 APK”的 MCP step，可以后续再加一个 `install_apk` step（本仓库当前 workflow step 里还没内置）。

```json
{
  "name": "after_install_smoke",
  "device_serial": "YOUR_SERIAL",
  "out_dir": "./recordings",
  "clear_logcat_first": true,
  "final_collect_artifacts": true,
  "logcat_lines": 8000,
  "record_screen": true,
  "steps": [
    { "type": "set_options", "values": { "fail_fast": true, "retry_max_attempts": 3, "retry_delay_s": 1.0 } },
    { "type": "clear_background_processes", "mode": "force_stop_3p", "run_kill_all_first": true },

    { "type": "reset_home", "home_presses": 2 },
    { "type": "ensure_launch", "query": "YOUR_APP_NAME", "package": "com.example.app", "reset_home": true, "home_presses": 2, "wait_s": 1.2 },

    { "type": "dismiss_popups", "name": "dismiss_startup_popups", "max_rounds": 3, "post_screenshot": true },

    {
      "type": "find_and_tap",
      "name": "tap_profile",
      "query": "个人中心",
      "exact": false,
      "pre_screenshot": true,
      "post_screenshot": true,
      "verify": [
        { "type": "find_on_screen", "query": "设置", "timeout_s": 6.0, "interval_s": 0.25 }
      ]
    },

    { "type": "collect_artifacts", "name": "after_profile" }
  ]
}
```


